flowchart TB
  Q["Rendered question"] --> R{"reasoning_level"}
  R -->|off| C1["Chat call with thinking disabled"]
  C1 --> S1["Answer text + chat logprobs"]
  S1 --> P1["Forced option scoring for MCQ"]

  R -->|b512/b2048/b8192/unlimited| T1["Thinking chat call"]
  T1 --> RT["Reasoning trace + answer text + reasoning tokens"]
  RT --> P2["Forced-answer probe: completions endpoint, max_tokens=1"]

  P1 --> OP["Normalized option probabilities"]
  P2 --> OP
  OP --> ECE["ECE/MCE/Brier from p(chosen) vs correctness"]
